      "dedupe_key": "deep-listening-sound-journey|2026-10-20|chats-palace-arts",
      "description": "Deep Listening Sound Journey Join us for a deeply relaxing sound journey, using the vibrational power of gongs and instruments to leave you energised and rejuvenated. Due to the success of initial sessions, I am happy to publish details of monthly Deep Listening Sound Journeys from June to November 2026. I am a local community artist and sound therapist, and I am delighted to continue a decades-old relationship with Chats Palace. Tuesdays 6:30pm gather, Session 7:00-8:15pm June 9th, July 14th, August 4th, September 22nd, October 20th, November 17th 3 ticket price-points according to income (no questions asked) “I loved the sonic and sensual journey that Jon created, and the qigong we did at the beginning to get our energy moving” Jacob “The sound journey was quite simply stunning! You took me to a range of places and it ended with feelings of love, joy and gratitude. “ Leena “Heaps of love to you for your sound journey. I felt a lot of you coming through, with the experience and reflection of all your life-learning and generosity of spirit.” Giles “Thank you so much for this evening – it was really special. Absolutely loved the movement to start also and the journey took me so deep! Thank you for making us feel safe and welcome.” Kate Get your place now!",
      "ends_at": "2026-10-20T19:30:00Z",
